; The ordinary text edge names the Nexus instance with its socket and the
; existing ordinary Input. HookConfiguration gives the Claude hook the same
; transport address while its event remains separate JSON on stdin.

Library
[ flow_ethos:OrdinarySocketPath
  signal_flow:Input ]
[ Invocation.{ OrdinarySocketPath Input }
  HookConfiguration.{ OrdinarySocketPath } ]
[]
[]
